        ['q' => 'Can guests book through our existing reservation system?', 'a' => 'We check whether the provider offers an embedded booking journey, supported links or an integration interface. The connection determines what can happen within your website. We map room identifiers, dates and confirmation states, then test the transition so guests understand which system holds their reservation.'],
